<title>TAIWAN: Formosa Jan-Mar pretax falls 5.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Formosa Jan-Mar pretax falls 5.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-March 1997</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				9,496 vs  8,038</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 1,485 vs  1,578</p>
<p>    Net profit			    1,237 vs  1,337</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (single T$)   0.54 vs   0.65</p>
<p>NOTE - Formosa Plastics Corp is one of the world's largest polyvinyl chloride (PVC) makers and head of the Formosa Plastics group.</p>
<p>-- Taipei newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
